---
title: "publishRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: authorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: hasEnded == true
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale not ended
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_refund --> q_check_published: refundEndTime < now
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period not ended
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_check_published --> q_set_capital: raisedCapital not yet published
    q_check_published --> q_revert_published: already published
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert AlreadyPublished
    q_set_capital --> [*]: set totalRaisedCapital, emit RaisedCapitalPublished

    note right of q_set_capital
        INV-001: published only after refund period ends
        INV-002: totalRaisedCapital <= totalCapitalInvested (after refunds)
        INV-003: required before projectAdmin can withdraw capital
    end note
